title: 주2_화_3교시_정문_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
(As I’m about to head down the main gate stairs, I see a familiar back.)
(NaHyun is crouching in front of some bushes.)
{name()}: NaHyun, what are you doing?
<<show hyun_spec>>
<<play 양나현_쉿>>
NaHyun: (Putting her index finger to her lips) Shh!
<<if get("slv") > 1>>
    <<jump 주2_화_3교시_정문_양나현_의존성_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주2_화_3교시_정문_양나현_일반_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_정문_양나현_의존성_영문
---
(I quickly shut my mouth and look down at where she’s staring. There’s a cat.)
(NaHyun is intently watching the cat.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: (Whispering) This cat lives here at the Engineering Building.
NaHyun: His name is Bong-won. You can run into him if you come around here sometimes.
{name()}: (Whispering) So this was the cat I kept seeing around.
<<choice 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_긍1_영문 "Of course I do." 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_부1_영문 "I'm not really a cat person.">>
NaHyun: Do you like cats?
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_정문_양나현_일반_영문
---
{name()}: What's wrong?
<<play 양나현_허>>
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: (Quietly) I told you to be quiet!
NaHyun: (Whispering) This cat lives at the Engineering Building.
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: His name is Bong-won. You can run into him if you come around here sometimes.
{name()}: (Whispering) So this was the cat I kept seeing around.
<<choice 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_긍1_영문 "Of course I do." 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_부1_영문 "I'm not really a cat person.">>
NaHyun: Do you like cats?
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_긍1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
{name()}: He's way too cute.
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: Me too. Out of all animals, cats are my favorite.
<<choice 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_긍2_영문 "Honestly, the naming sense is... not great." 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_부2_영문 "No, I think it's actually pretty cute.">>
NaHyun: Bong-won. Isn't that name hilarious?
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_부1_영문
---
{name()}: I don't like them that much.
NaHyun: Oh, I see...
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Cats are my absolute favorite animal.
(NaHyun seems to have her full attention on the cat.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_긍2_영문
---
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -10>>
{name()}: I'm a bit curious who named him.
{name()}: I mean, how do you end up naming a cat 'Bong-won'?
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: Actually, I named him.
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
{name()}: Oh......
(A moment of awkward silence follows.)
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Bong-won soon stands up and disappears into the bushes.)
NaHyun: I'm going to head back inside now.
(NaHyun stands up and walks back into the Engineering Building.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_아산공학관_정문_양나현_부2_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
{name()}: It suits him well.
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: Really? Actually, I named him.
NaHyun: I thought the name Bong-won really fit him.
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Bong-won soon stands up and disappears into the bushes.)
(We talked a little more about Bong-won.)
NaHyun: Come by the main gate every now and then. Let's visit Bong-won together.
{name()}: Sure.
<<end>>
===